# Zaiko Product Screenshot Directory

This directory is prepared to host official Zaiko product screenshots in WebP format when available:

- zaiko-hero.webp
- zaiko-inventory.webp
- zaiko-purchases.webp
- zaiko-activity.webp
- zaiko-costs.webp

The `ZaikoProductVisual` component supports loading these images automatically when provided, or rendering responsive high-fidelity abstract UI compositions when images are absent.
